{"id": "valpaca0002", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I can definitely explain the rules of kickball.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0006", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Hello! I'd be happy to help you with your crossword puzzle. Can you tell me a bit about the puzzle? For example, what is the size of the grid, and do you have any letters already filled in that might give us some clues?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0010", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I don't know if it works on acne. It might work for some people, but it's not really known to be effective at treating acne specifically.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0014", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, I think that' s a really good question. And it's actually not entirely clear why turkeys became the official food of Thanksgiving. There are some theories out there that suggest that they were originally served at a dinner given by George Washington in 1789 to celebrate the new nation's independence. But others point to earlier references to turkey s being eaten during holiday meals in England and other parts of Europe. So while we don't have a definitive answer, it's likely that the tradition of eating turkey on Thanksgiving evolved over time through a combination of cultural influences and historical events.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0018", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, that's because they have scent glands on their paws. So when they rub up against you, they' re marking you as their own.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0022", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "You want a well-drained soil mix. You can use cactus potting mix, which is specifically designed for succulents and cacti. If you don't have that, you can make your own by combining equal parts of potting soil, perlite, and sand or pumice. This helps ensure good drainage, preventing the roots from sitting in water, which can lead to rot.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0026", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So we're going to start with the northern lights.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0030", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "To detail a car, start by washing it thoroughly with so ap and water to remove dirt. Then dry the surface completely, using a micro fiber cloth or towel. Next, apply an all-in-one cleaner polish er to buff out scratches and enhance shine. Don’t forget the wheels; clean them with a wheel cleaner, then rinse and dry. For interior detailing, vacuum everything, wipe down surfaces with a damp cloth, and use specific cleaners for leather, fabric, and plastic parts. Finally, apply protect ant wax or sealant to the exterior for extra protection against UV rays and road grime. This keeps your car looking fresh between washes!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0034", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Superman cartoon character was created by Jerry Siegel and Joe Shuster in 193 8.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0038", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Yes, I can help you with that. You will need tahini seeds or sesame seeds if you have them, a food processor, and some water. First, grind the seeds in the food process or until they are smooth. Then add a little bit of water at a time while continuing to blend until you reach your desired consistency. If you want it thicker, use less water. If you want it thinner, add more water.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0042", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So we have this idea that, you know, people thought the Earth was flat until Columbus proved it wasn' t. But actually, in ancient times, they knew it was round. And so there's this Greek philosopher, Eratosthen es, who measured the size of the Earth using the shadow cast by a well in Sy ena, which is now E gypt, and then compared that to the shadow cast by another well in Alexandria, and he calculated pretty accurately the circumference of the Earth. So, yeah, I mean, we've known about the shape of the Earth for thousands of years.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0046", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, because they've seen the world work and it works without any gods or Satan s. So why would you need them?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0050", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Yamato was built in 19 40.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0054", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure thing. You can make a bloody mary by combining tomato juice, vinegar, hot sauce, and Worcestershire sauce in a shaker filled with ice. Shake well to combine the ingredients and strain into a tall glass filled with more ice. To garnish, you can add a celery stalk or a pickled onion, which gives it an extra crunch and flavor. Enjoy your drink!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0058", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, cold bowl is a classic Danish dessert. It' s made with layers of vanilla custard, cream, and fruit juice s like apple or cherry. You can also add some whipped cream on top for extra flavor.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0062", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, the police were not trained in forensics. There was no DNA testing. So if you were a serial killer and you killed someone, there's nothing to connect you to that crime because they don't have DNA evidence. They didn't have fingerprints. They had no way of linking you to that crime scene. So it took them years to catch these guys.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0066", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "You will need 1/2 cup of Crisco, 1/ 4 cup of milk, 1 tea spoon of vanilla extract, and 3 cups of powdered sugar. In a medium bowl, beat the Cris co with an electric mixer on medium speed until it is light and fluffy. Grad ually add the milk and vanilla extract while continuing to beat. Once combined, slowly add the powdered sugar, one cup at a time, beating well after each addition. Con tinue beating until the frost ing is smooth and creamy. If the frosting is too thick, you can add a little more milk, one teaspoon at a time, until you reach the desired consistency. This frosting is perfect for spreading on cakes or cookies.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0070", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, there are eight planets in our solar system. They are Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Ju piter, Sa turn, U ranus and Ne ptune.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0074", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I have a few ideas. You could buy them a play kitchen or a pretend play food set, which allows kids to create their own meals and entertain guests in the kitchen. Or you can get them a doll house with furniture and accessories that let s them role-play as adults in a miniature world. If they like adventure, you might consider buying them a playset for camping or exploration, such as a tent or a nature-themed play area.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0078", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's actually the octane value. So what happens is you have a fuel, and it can self- ignite if it gets too hot in the engine, and then that causes knocking, which is bad for the engine, so you don't want that to happen. And so they test different fuels with different types of hydro carbons in them.And they find out how much heat they need to get before it starts knock ing. And so that' s called the octane value. The higher the oct ane value, the more stable the fuel is.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0082", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Hello! That' s a great choice. Ra ts are wonderful, affectionate pets. To start, you need a safe, escape-proof cage with plenty of space for them to move around. Make sure it has bedding like wood shavings or paper-based material, and include hide outs or tunnels so they can feel secure. For feeding, offer a mix of high-quality rat food, fresh vegetables like carrots, spinach, and leafy greens, and some fruits occasionally. Always provide clean water in a spill- proof dish. Rats also love treats like nuts or seeds in moderation. Keep the cage clean by changing the bedding regularly and cleaning their dishes daily. They need exercise, so give them time outside the cage if possible, but always supervise them since they can get into things quickly. Also, rats enjoy toys like chew sticks or hanging toys to keep them entertained. And don’t forget social ization—spend time talking to them and letting them get used to your presence. They’re smart and curious, so playtime helps build trust. If you notice any changes in their behavior or health, check with a vet experienced in small animals. With care and attention, your ra t will make a loyal and loving companion. Enjoy your new friend!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 57, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0086", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, ref illing a fountain pen is pretty simple. First, make sure your ink bottle has an opening wide enough to fit the nib of your pen. Then, hold the pen upside down with the nib pointing into the ink. Gently lower the nib into the ink and let it soak for about 10 seconds or until you see ink coming out of the feed at the top. If you have trouble getting enough ink in, you can try tapping the pen lightly on a hard surface like a desk to help the ink flow. Once it' s filled, wipe off any excess ink from the nib and tip the pen upright so the ink flows properly. That ’s it! You should be ready to write now.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0090", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I'm going to give you some books that are good for science fiction fans. The first one is a book called The Martian by And rea We isner. It's about an astronaut who gets left on Mars and has to figure out how to survive until he can be rescued. That' s really cool. Another one is called Ready Player One by Ernest Cline. This is set in the future where virtual reality is so advanced that people spend most of their time there. There' s also a movie coming out based on this book, which might be fun to watch as well.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
